<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1751785262"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:13.993"><div begin="5.192" end="30.881" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="5.192" end="9.916" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5.192" end="6.867">别喝得</span><span begin="6.867" end="7.952">太</span><span begin="7.952" end="9.916">醉</span></p><p begin="13.759" end="15.983" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.759" end="14.391">霓虹</span><span begin="14.391" end="14.914">灯光下面</span><span begin="14.914" end="15.185">美艳</span><span begin="15.185" end="15.983">泛滥</span></p><p begin="16.002" end="17.701" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.002" end="17.106">没有人能成为我的</span><span begin="17.106" end="17.701">对手</span></p><p begin="17.868" end="20.273" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.868" end="19.692">管他挂着一把钥匙价值家财</span><span begin="19.692" end="20.273">万贯</span></p><p begin="20.430" end="22.195" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.430" end="21.611">可能口袋里什麼也都</span><span begin="21.611" end="22.195">没有</span></p><p begin="22.374" end="24.635" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.374" end="23.019">出乎我的</span><span begin="23.019" end="23.510">意料</span><span begin="23.510" end="24.086">都会做上</span><span begin="24.086" end="24.635">记号</span></p><p begin="24.645" end="26.450" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.645" end="24.936">接着</span><span begin="24.936" end="25.178">计</span><span begin="25.178" end="25.762">划着一箭</span><span begin="25.762" end="26.450">双雕</span></p><p begin="26.530" end="28.645" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.530" end="26.855">后知</span><span begin="26.855" end="27.461">后觉</span><span begin="27.461" end="28.194">有人拍了我的</span><span begin="28.194" end="28.645">肩膀</span></p><p begin="28.745" end="30.881" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.745" end="30.148">然后开始看着很真挚的</span><span begin="30.148" end="30.881">假笑</span></p></div><div begin="30.945" end="48.736" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="30.945" end="33.053" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.945" end="32.682">你的声音太出</span><span begin="32.682" end="33.053">众</span></p><p begin="33.202" end="35.359" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.202" end="34.818">你的风格太明</span><span begin="34.818" end="35.359">显</span></p><p begin="35.390" end="39.879" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.390" end="38.195">听说你周六经常来请你</span> <span begin="38.195" end="39.235">当我是个</span><span begin="39.235" end="39.879">fan</span></p><p begin="39.883" end="41.928" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.883" end="41.003">听过你的</span><span begin="41.003" end="41.307">On</span> <span begin="41.307" end="41.587">The</span> <span begin="41.587" end="41.928">Road</span></p><p begin="42.063" end="44.337" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.063" end="42.983">CDC</span> <span begin="42.983" end="43.754">永远的</span><span begin="43.754" end="44.337">Gang</span></p><p begin="44.347" end="46.558" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.347" end="44.624">I've</span> <span begin="44.624" end="44.862">been</span> <span begin="44.862" end="45.448">watchin'</span> <span begin="45.448" end="45.697">you</span> <span begin="45.697" end="46.029">for</span> <span begin="46.029" end="46.341">a</span> <span begin="46.341" end="46.558">while</span></p><p begin="46.568" end="48.736" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.568" end="48.232">这里是我的名</span><span begin="48.232" end="48.736">片</span></p></div><div begin="48.746" end="1:06.547" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="48.746" end="51.007" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.746" end="49.338">我的朋友</span><span begin="49.338" end="49.613">多</span> <span begin="49.613" end="50.274">多的就像</span><span begin="50.274" end="51.007">狼狗</span></p><p begin="51.017" end="53.168" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.017" end="51.302">全世</span><span begin="51.302" end="51.604">界</span><span begin="51.604" end="52.377">各地都有我的</span><span begin="52.377" end="53.168">堂口</span></p><p begin="53.178" end="55.433" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.178" end="53.514">我是</span> <span begin="53.514" end="54.141">天才</span> <span begin="54.141" end="54.610">天赋没法</span><span begin="54.610" end="55.433">抢走</span></p><p begin="55.443" end="57.515" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.443" end="55.763">教</span><span begin="55.763" end="56.051">他们</span><span begin="56.051" end="56.273">rap</span> <span begin="56.273" end="56.582">教</span><span begin="56.582" end="56.878">乔丹</span><span begin="56.878" end="57.099">防</span><span begin="57.099" end="57.515">守</span></p><p begin="57.661" end="59.600" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.661" end="58.173">不管我的</span> <span begin="58.173" end="59.301">存在有多少人不会</span><span begin="59.301" end="59.600">信</span></p><p begin="59.610" end="1:02.091" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.610" end="1:00.157">绝对不会</span><span begin="1:00.157" end="1:00.509">听</span> <span begin="1:00.509" end="1:01.284">今天喝酒不要</span><span begin="1:01.284" end="1:02.091">想走</span></p><p begin="1:02.101" end="1:06.547" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.101" end="1:02.685">这个世界</span><span begin="1:02.685" end="1:03.213">变奏</span><span begin="1:03.213" end="1:03.808">还在一直</span><span begin="1:03.808" end="1:04.194">变</span> <span begin="1:04.418" end="1:05.218">能否请你过来</span><span begin="1:05.218" end="1:05.423">当</span><span begin="1:05.423" end="1:05.727">我的</span><span begin="1:05.727" end="1:06.547">帮手</span></p></div><div begin="1:06.557" end="1:24.009" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:06.557" end="1:10.440" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.557" end="1:06.686">我</span><span begin="1:06.686" end="1:06.978">能</span><span begin="1:06.978" end="1:07.658">够让你</span><span begin="1:07.658" end="1:08.232">红</span> <span begin="1:08.232" end="1:08.418">能</span><span begin="1:08.418" end="1:08.683">红</span><span begin="1:08.683" end="1:08.792">过</span><span begin="1:08.792" end="1:09.168">那些</span><span begin="1:09.168" end="1:09.352">个</span><span begin="1:09.352" end="1:09.888">新鲜的</span><span begin="1:09.888" end="1:10.440">血液</span></p><p begin="1:10.693" end="1:15.088" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.693" end="1:11.056">哦</span> <span begin="1:11.056" end="1:11.512">你的</span><span begin="1:11.512" end="1:12.008">beef</span><span begin="1:12.198" end="1:13.099">要剃掉骨头</span> <span begin="1:13.099" end="1:13.845">我都可以</span><span begin="1:13.845" end="1:15.088">帮你解决</span></p><p begin="1:15.098" end="1:19.540" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.098" end="1:15.370">我</span><span begin="1:15.370" end="1:15.930">会</span> <span begin="1:16.037" end="1:16.551">拿走</span><span begin="1:16.551" end="1:16.972">你的</span><span begin="1:16.972" end="1:17.724">负罪感</span> <span begin="1:17.724" end="1:18.618">像钢琴</span><span begin="1:18.618" end="1:18.791">的</span><span begin="1:18.791" end="1:19.540">琴键</span></p><p begin="1:19.550" end="1:24.009" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.550" end="1:21.083">会满足你对</span><span begin="1:21.083" end="1:21.235">音</span><span begin="1:21.235" end="1:22.022">乐的愿</span><span begin="1:22.022" end="1:22.328">望</span> <span begin="1:22.464" end="1:23.549">一切都应</span><span begin="1:23.549" end="1:24.009">验</span></p></div><div begin="1:24.019" end="1:38.554" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:24.019" end="1:29.492" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.019" end="1:24.982">别喝得太醉</span> <span begin="1:25.198" end="1:26.616">别喝得</span><span begin="1:26.896" end="1:27.949">太</span><span begin="1:27.949" end="1:29.492">醉</span></p><p begin="1:32.919" end="1:38.554" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.919" end="1:33.802">别喝得太醉</span> <span begin="1:34.009" end="1:35.569">别喝得</span><span begin="1:35.729" end="1:36.812">太</span><span begin="1:36.812" end="1:38.554">醉</span></p></div><div begin="1:42.359" end="1:59.797" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:42.359" end="1:44.690" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.359" end="1:42.703">不要</span><span begin="1:42.703" end="1:43.516">喝得太醉</span> <span begin="1:43.516" end="1:43.839">最好</span><span begin="1:43.839" end="1:44.380">提醒自</span><span begin="1:44.380" end="1:44.690">己</span></p><p begin="1:44.873" end="1:46.818" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.873" end="1:46.818">知己知彼再对过去致敬</span></p><p begin="1:46.828" end="1:49.201" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:46.828" end="1:47.092">那些</span><span begin="1:47.092" end="1:47.396">烦</span><span begin="1:47.396" end="1:48.700">心的傀儡他们早已选择</span><span begin="1:48.700" end="1:49.201">背对</span></p><p begin="1:49.285" end="1:51.593" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:49.285" end="1:49.552">惯</span><span begin="1:49.552" end="1:51.034">性的退避只能黑你德不</span><span begin="1:51.034" end="1:51.593">配位</span></p><p begin="1:52.014" end="1:54.806" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.014" end="1:52.675">最好放弃</span><span begin="1:52.675" end="1:53.299">辩驳</span> <span begin="1:53.534" end="1:54.270">接受命运的</span><span begin="1:54.270" end="1:54.806">颠簸</span></p><p begin="1:54.816" end="1:56.533" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.816" end="1:55.331">竞技的</span><span begin="1:55.331" end="1:55.755">片刻</span> <span begin="1:55.755" end="1:56.003">用力</span><span begin="1:56.003" end="1:56.533">干</span></p><p begin="1:56.760" end="1:59.797" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.760" end="1:57.595">那些看不起</span><span begin="1:57.595" end="1:57.835">你</span><span begin="1:57.835" end="1:58.741">的早晚歇斯底</span><span begin="1:58.741" end="1:58.928">里</span><span begin="1:58.928" end="1:59.384">要送你</span><span begin="1:59.384" end="1:59.797">炭</span></p></div><div begin="1:59.807" end="2:17.563" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:59.807" end="2:04.173" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.807" end="2:00.116">所以</span><span begin="2:00.116" end="2:00.421">说</span> <span begin="2:00.421" end="2:01.026">想像</span><span begin="2:01.026" end="2:01.301">你的</span><span begin="2:01.301" end="2:01.991">薪水</span> <span begin="2:02.239" end="2:02.673">来跟我</span><span begin="2:02.673" end="2:03.281">讲讲</span><span begin="2:03.281" end="2:03.479">你的</span><span begin="2:03.479" end="2:04.173">心扉</span></p><p begin="2:04.565" end="2:08.624" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:04.565" end="2:04.920">再别</span><span begin="2:04.920" end="2:05.504">佯装</span><span begin="2:05.504" end="2:05.757">你不</span><span begin="2:05.757" end="2:06.346">心动</span> <span begin="2:06.519" end="2:07.104">不想富丽</span><span begin="2:07.104" end="2:07.680">堂皇</span><span begin="2:07.680" end="2:08.018">受人</span><span begin="2:08.018" end="2:08.624">钦佩</span></p><p begin="2:08.709" end="2:13.045" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:08.709" end="2:09.333">我能给你</span><span begin="2:09.333" end="2:09.922">亮光</span><span begin="2:09.922" end="2:10.485">收起你的</span><span begin="2:10.485" end="2:11.050">荒唐</span><span begin="2:11.050" end="2:11.589">既然收了</span><span begin="2:11.589" end="2:12.156">奖赏</span><span begin="2:12.156" end="2:12.444">就该</span><span begin="2:12.444" end="2:13.045">欣慰</span></p><p begin="2:13.368" end="2:17.563" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:13.368" end="2:13.811">要麼先</span><span begin="2:13.811" end="2:14.461">想想</span> <span begin="2:14.461" end="2:14.912">曾经的</span><span begin="2:14.912" end="2:15.664">彷徨</span> <span begin="2:15.664" end="2:15.974">再来</span><span begin="2:15.974" end="2:16.585">商量</span><span begin="2:16.585" end="2:16.854">如何</span><span begin="2:16.854" end="2:17.563">进退</span></p></div><div begin="2:17.865" end="2:38.097" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:17.865" end="2:20.395" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:17.865" end="2:18.220">我的</span><span begin="2:18.220" end="2:18.609"